  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2702.01 Availability of Returns. Paper returns may be obtained by:\n\n(a) Writing to:\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Revenue Administration\n\nP.O. Box 3006\n\nConcord, NH 03302-3006; or\n\n(b) Calling the forms line at (603) 230-5001.\n\nSource. #8226, INTERIM, eff 12-10-04, EXPIRES: 6-8-05; ss by #8371, eff 6-8-05; ss by #10387, eff 7-25-13; ss by #12907, eff 10-23-19; ss by #13661, eff 6-21-23",
